<title>USA: All-Com withdraws share offering.</title>
<headline>All-Com withdraws share offering.</headline>
<dateline>CULVER CITY, Calif. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>All-Comm Media Corp said Tuesday it intended to withdraw its proposed public offering of 2.1 million shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders were to offer 350,000 of the shares.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the withdrawal was due to market conditions. It said it was evaluating alternative financing possibilities.</p>
<p>All-Comm provides database management and other direct marketing services.</p>
